            <listBibl>
               <bibl xml:id="S"><title>无骨者伊瓦尔《战国历史地图·年表》</title><note xml:lang="eng">Chronology spreadsheet 疆域变化年表 (draft 3, patch 2), Shiji tab; the Shiji text follows the edition used by the compiler.</note></bibl>
